# Terraform variable files. These carry real values and must stay out of the
# repo — with one deliberate exception: the placeholder file the Trivy job feeds
# to the scanner. It holds nothing real and has to be committed for CI to read
# it. Terraform will not auto-load it under this name.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!terraform/scan.tfvars

